Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=24}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.31,0:01:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now which one of you is Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:01.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Well, that just\Nhappens to be my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good. You can call me Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.97,0:02:06.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...? What are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:09.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN R] Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN H] Hahaha!\NWhere do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN R] You wanna talk to the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you gotta talk\Nto us first. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:20.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So let's talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.53,0:02:29.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what does a pirate want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:53.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:02.08,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Luffy... Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:05.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's for making our navigator cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Back off!\NYou're outta your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:19.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You just {\i1}had{\i0} to run\Non ahead by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I can handle\Nthese bozos on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.34,0:03:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never said anything\Nabout being worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just don't want you\Nhoggin' all the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:31.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:35.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I just wanna let you guys know\Nthat I don't mind if you hog it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] I see you're raring to go as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:41.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Ohhh! It's him...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:44.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the unknown swordsman\NI was telling you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:46.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard tricked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:49.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:52.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I fell for it. Hook, line, and sinker...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:55.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hook, line, and sinker...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:57.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whaaa?! But... He's dead...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.68,0:04:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We saw Nami kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph! That Nami was\Na traitor all along...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:08.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:18.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Who are those guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY] Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy just decked Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:29.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No human should be able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:31.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are they...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.09,0:04:33.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't we tell you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stay back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:38.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[JOHNNY] Now do you understand\Nwhy we're keeping you away from that fight...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:40.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys'll just get in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:42.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:47.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What reason could {\i1}they{\i0}\Npossibly have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.51,0:04:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Big Sis Nami was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:59.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YOSAKU] Do they need any more reason\Nthan that to put their lives on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] This is all\Nstarting to make sense now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:13.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been after\NNami this whole time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.02,0:05:14.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.79,0:05:18.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The girl is mine and\NI'm not giving her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:20.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.33,0:05:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bunch of idiots like\Nyou aren't worth Arlong's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:26.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know how to deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:32.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[trumpet fanfare]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:35.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no... It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] What is goin' on here, guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Momoo! Rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.05,0:05:58.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the beast from the Grand Line\Nthat destroyed the town of Gosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaauugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:15.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's actually real...! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.01,0:06:16.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Momoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.11,0:06:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems he's a friend of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:32.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...! Stop...! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't just leave! Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leaving...? Now, now...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:50.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ARLONG] But... I suppose if you really want\Nto run away, then who am I to stop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:54.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] It's coming right for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:13.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Aaaaahh!\NI'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're all mine...! You dumb cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:24.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:30.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's got a plan... For once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:34.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll see. I've got a\Nbad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His arms stretched!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:58.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So he must have devil fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:07:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:00.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, who cares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:02.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[FISHMAN U] Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.09,0:08:04.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait...! What's he gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I want to find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Time for something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:18.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pinwheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.47,0:08:31.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's it, Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.64,0:08:32.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing games with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to\Nbeat down all your cronies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I came here to teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.61,0:08:40.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I will, don't worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was just thinking about\Nhow painfully I'll end your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was the worst plan ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Were you trying\Nto kill all of us too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:09:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That boy's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.57,0:09:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe there's a human\Nwho could throw that giant monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's as if the gods\Nthemselves are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:14.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN] How dare you hurt our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems that we must\Nnow join in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:23.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you'll get an education in the\Ninferiority of your species. Choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.51,0:09:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... really... I'd like to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:32.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax, sir... Let us handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you go on one of your\Nrampages to squash these insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:39.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you could destroy all\Nof Arlong Park. Choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please just let us\Nkill these weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright... They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys... There's\Nsomething I should tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell's that octopus doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Octopus is best when\Nit's cut thin and salted...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Add some olive oil and paprika and it makes\Nthe perfect snack while drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So listen to me, guys,\NI'm kind of in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this! Zero Vision!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hachi Ink Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:18.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot...! How come\Nyou didn't dodge that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:22.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaah! I can't see squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:25.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now to finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Get outta there, Luffy! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:33.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah, that's the problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't run! I can't even walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] My feet are kinda stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who stuck 'em\Ninto the ground in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Always thinking ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One Hachi Ink Jet served on the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:11.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're such a pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.89,0:11:15.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, that was so\Ntotally awesomely awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like I ended up picking one\Nhell of an idiot to be my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:20.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:23.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy's great...! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the truth... is that our\Nidiot captain is far better
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,than a gang who'd prey on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:31.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A lady, huh? Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You rushed into certain\Ndeath for one lousy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:38.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Lousy girl"...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you insult Nami one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can promise that you'll go\Nfrom fishman to fish sticks...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:45.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:48.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KUROOBI] Your skills are\Nquite exceptional for a human...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I must admit that chivalry from\Na pirate seems just a little fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:58.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm damn good at what I do,\Nand I guarantee you there's nothing fake
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:01.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about my desire to help\Na beautiful lady in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.83,0:12:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Looks like I'll be acquainting you with\Nthe true superiority of the fishman species.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:15.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice work... But they're {\i1}still{\i0} stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:18.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Still? They're still stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We could pull all day...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:23.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I bet my legs would\Nstill be stuck in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying at all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or do you want to stay stuck here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:32.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe no one told you that the penalty\Nfor playing around in Arlong Park...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:33.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:35.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP panicked cries] C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get unstuck already! Get unstuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:42.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hey, Octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.29,0:12:45.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're a little bit\Nbusy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohh! You're Zoro...! I forgot...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:55.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't get away with tricking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:03.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[HATCHAN] And how dare you mercilessly\Nslaughter so many of my brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.51,0:13:06.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That stuff's old news, octopus man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I personally don't care what reasons\Nyou have for wanting to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The situation has changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, the tables have turned...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.09,0:13:16.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not the hunters\Nanymore, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's {\i1}you{\i0} fish freaks\Nwho're being hunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:19.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you tell him, Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:24.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That octopus guy is yours... Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.99,0:13:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:36.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:40.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:41.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get it now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must actually want me to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:50.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the guy who\Nsaved Genzo's life earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.62,0:13:58.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait... You're the\Npeople from Cocoyashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:00.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Judging from the fact\Nthat you all have weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:04.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can only assume\Nthat this is a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:05.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you'll all have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.33,0:14:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[USOPP] Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:09.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Big Bro Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you think it would be easy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with {\i1}me{\i0} now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:18.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get rid of you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who is that lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brave one minute and cowardly the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:29.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a baffling man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:34.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHOO] Get back here, "long nose"!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Oh, you're one\Nto talk, "big mouth."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.19,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Why are these people pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:47.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You morons are a\Npathetic sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But sir, there's no\Nreason to go on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.15,0:14:54.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think of Arlong Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Don't worry, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just thought of\Na fun game, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:02.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think your\Nsad little group can defeat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:12.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what if we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what if we do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:15.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:17.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got something to say to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:27.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No way! No way! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you know that those with\Ndevil fruit powers can't swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:36.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But honestly, anybody in this situation\Nwould sink right to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:37.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The sea...?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:43.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:49.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:51.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.74,0:15:55.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:13.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG] Ahahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Wait! Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.65,0:16:18.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those fishmen can't wait for us\Nto jump in the water after him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'd have an obvious advantage\Nin an underwater fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:27.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] There's only one way to save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta take these guys out at\Nthe same time, then go in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:34.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] There's no time,\Ncome on, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:34.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:37.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how long can he hold out, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.87,0:16:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:41.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can take the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.47,0:16:49.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You slice and trim the octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:06.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] This is bad...\NI'm almost outta breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:08.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What now?! He can't help himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:20.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ARLONG laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:23.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can't even breathe underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humans are such pitiful\Ncreatures, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.85,0:17:27.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...! Calamari...! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:35.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[HATCHAN laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Game! Game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:39.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass\Nin five seconds flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't have more than three!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... What's the rush...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're both running\Nheadlong into death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:48.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of you will\Nleave this place alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Aw, crap! I'm gonna be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll beat his ass real quick and\Nthen come save you, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.07,0:18:11.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[HATCHAN] Hachi Ink Jet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:26.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:27.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.20,0:18:28.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll grow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.29,0:18:31.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, Zoro, you can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have six hands that will mesmerize\Nyou with their wiggly beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hachi's {\alpha&HFF&\t(1140,1141,\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&)}Triple {\alpha&HFF&\t(1700,1701,\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&)}Sword {\alpha&HFF&\t(2270,2271,\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&)}Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, you will see my skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:48.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:49.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:55.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is he still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lose focus and you lose your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:19:00.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I bet you taste good with butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.32,0:19:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:14.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Hachi's suckers are stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't just stick there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get down here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.50,0:19:21.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to waste our time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if we try to save Luffy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:30.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they'll just drag us to the bottom\Nof the sea and we'll drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we sit here and do nothing,\Nthen Luffy drowns for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:35.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've got to think\Nof a way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:37.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:42.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What good are the two of you gonna do\Nin the sea when you both can barely walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:45.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to figure out a\Nway to save that young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then I believe I should be the\None to volunteer ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.57,0:19:54.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.57,0:19:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.66,0:20:00.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The fishmen will suspect that we're up to\Nsomething if we go with such a large crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I fear doing so may\Ncause more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we could help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:05.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not another word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no point endangering\Nmore people than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:13.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:14.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But please, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:18.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Genzo, I'm going too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:23.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:27.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're not going to leave me out of this when\Nthose guys are fighting for my sister's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:30.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.81,0:20:32.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.13,0:20:32.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:35.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:39.12,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If only I was stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.55,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Please save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.56,0:20:42.14,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:50.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question that I've\Nbeen meaning to ask you, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.25,0:20:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're famous for your\Nthree-sword technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why are you only using one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:55.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're running scared with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.39,0:20:56.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would I need three?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.57,0:20:57.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:20:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've just been playing around with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.47,0:21:01.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, humans can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:04.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can tell you why, but I think\Nit'd be more fun to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:05.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, show.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:09.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you're really going\Nto enjoy it a lot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:11.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:13.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't fight back the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:21.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:22.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:27.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You still haven't recovered\Nfrom your fight with Hawkeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:28.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you may tremble in fear\Nat Hachi's way of six blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.73,0:21:39.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to die yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:41.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't even killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.15,0:21:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.63,0:21:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's been faking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:47.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:52.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The way he's been pummeled would kill any\Nnormal guy, but he tries to fight anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought it was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.92,0:22:02.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He walked around just like nothing had\Nhappened after such a horrible fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:03.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's laid out flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you to pay attention\Nto me, you weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a 40th dan in Fishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.47,0:22:17.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.53,0:22:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the... what the\Nhell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.27,0:22:22.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:23.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It can't be him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.41,0:22:27.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:32.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're taken care of, Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.73,0:22:34.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What would you like\Nus to do with Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.19,0:22:38.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just toss him in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.03,0:22:39.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hardly entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.09,0:22:42.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:43.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They did manage to\Nmake a bit of a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.22,0:22:48.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}As long as Arlong Park is still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.19,0:22:52.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.77,0:22:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.33,0:22:57.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He killed himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:23:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never got the chance to show him\Nhow great of a swordsman I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:04.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If he could have died on one of my six\Nblades, I could have stolen his fame!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:09.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There isn't a human alive that can\Ncompare to my way of six blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.69,0:23:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Behold the superior power that only a\Nsix-armed master swordsman can attain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:24.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:26.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I understand how you must feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:30.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But if you continue this little\Ndemonstration, you'll destroy Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.07,0:23:34.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:37.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I forgot I could destroy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.61,0:23:38.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:41.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:43.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way of six blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.56,0:23:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.11,0:23:56.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:24:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me make this clear for you,\Nyou sorry excuse for a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a certain man I have to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:11.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And until I see him, death\Nhimself cannot touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.92,0:24:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.17,0:24:35.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the best punch\Nthat fishman's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.26,0:24:41.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The old man's kicks were a\Nhundred times worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.82,0:24:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I never even died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:46.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.76,0:24:50.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[Caitlin Glass singing "Run! Run! Run!"]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=25}===============================DIALOGUE============================
